SUMMARY:Walk Through the Seasons
DESCRIPTION:All programs at Prairie Ridge currently require pre-registration. Register for this program for ages 5+\nDiscover the shifting beauty of nature with a monthly Walk through the Seasons at Prairie Ridge. Led by an experienced naturalist\, you will explore both woods and prairie while learning to read the landscape. During the hike\, we will turn curiosity into discovery using iNaturalist. You’ll learn how to snapshot mystery plants and animals\, turning your phone into a powerful tool for collaborative science.
